## Version 2.3.2 release notes

### Security fixes

* Updated UI `undici` to v8.10.2, addressing CVE-2026-84961, a TLS certificate validation bypass ([#5749](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5749)).
* Updated `google.golang.org/grpc` to v1.83.2, addressing CVE-2026-84445 ([#5609](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5609), [#5610](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5610)).
* Updated OpenTelemetry trace exporters to v1.45.0 ([#5649](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5649), [#5650](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5650), [#5651](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5651)).
* Updated OpenTelemetry log modules to v0.21.0 ([#5722](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5722)).
* Updated UI `js-yaml` to v4.3.2 ([#5616](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5616)).
* Updated UI `brace-expansion` to v5.0.12 ([#5705](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5705)).

### Documentation

* Expanded recording rules CLI documentation, added Rust jemalloc profiling documentation and a v2.0 upgrade guide, and corrected profile type documentation ([#5622](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5622)).

